Task 3 — beaver status and process detection

Reason:
- The durable Ollama receipt does not persist the HTTP port, so status reports process presence instead of claiming service health.
- Model storage resolution reuses the existing spawn-profile authority.
- Beaver launches Ollama under a gated executable name on Unix; the CLI now reuses that gate-name parser instead of duplicating its format.
- Filesystem scans are bounded, saturating, and do not follow symbolic links.

